  "details": "Feature Request:\n\nAn option that turns nameplates off when they are too close to you (Similar to personal space but for the nameplates specifically)\n\nReasoning:\n\nBeing close to people who are sitting down, or who are shorter than you can cause their nameplates to be really close to your face/camera and really large which can potentially:\n\n- Block your view\n\n- Cause discomfort\n\n- Decrease performance through additional transparency calculations per pixel covered by the nameplate\n\n- Cause reactions in photo sensitive epilepsy due to flashing elements such as the voice effect",
